    "isDuplicateOf": null,
    "content": "Lawmakers in the United States examined the regulatory challenges posed by artificial intelligence agents, stablecoins, and tokenized securities during a House Financial Services Committee hearing. Discussions focused on how software-driven digital financial transactions are authorized and settled, highlighting the intersection of emerging technology, economic policy, and traditional financial regulation.",
